{"pageid":3497,"title":"Corrupted tumbleweed","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Corrupted tumbleweed</span>","revid":19745,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ee/Corrupted_Tumbleweed1.png.png/revision/latest?cb=20241109191414\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A Corrupted Tumbleweed\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ee/Corrupted_Tumbleweed1.png.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241109191414\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Corrupted Tumbleweed1.png.png\" data-image-key=\"Corrupted_Tumbleweed1.png.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Corrupted_Tumbleweed1.png.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">A Corrupted Tumbleweed</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ac/Corrupted_Tumbleweed_next_to_player.png/revision/latest?cb=20241109191542\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A Corrupted Tumbleweed next to a player\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ac/Corrupted_Tumbleweed_next_to_player.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241109191542\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"140\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Corrupted Tumbleweed next to player.png\" data-image-key=\"Corrupted_Tumbleweed_next_to_player.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Corrupted_Tumbleweed_next_to_player.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">A Corrupted Tumbleweed next to a player</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d4/Corrupted_tumbleweed_jar.png/revision/latest?cb=20250519103251\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"corrupted tumbleweed jar\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d4/Corrupted_tumbleweed_jar.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250519103251\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"284\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Corrupted tumbleweed jar.png\" data-image-key=\"Corrupted_tumbleweed_jar.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Corrupted_tumbleweed_jar.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">corrupted tumbleweed jar</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <b>corrupted tumbleweed</b> is a purple tumbleweed with a pink/purple core inside it that emits a spiral effect. It is estimated to be 2.5x-3x larger than a normal tumbleweed.\n</p><p>During the 2024 Halloween event, corrupted tumbleweed would spawn throughout the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Oke desert (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvT2tlX2Rlc2VydD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Oke Desert</span>. When approached, the tumbleweed will start rolling towards the player and deal damage on contact. When grabbed, they would immediately become docile. <sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8a/Sell_price_of_corrupted_tumbleweed.png/revision/latest?cb=20250704193911\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Sell Price of Corrupted Tumbleweed\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"133\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Sell price of corrupted tumbleweed.png\" data-image-key=\"Sell_price_of_corrupted_tumbleweed.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8a/Sell_price_of_corrupted_tumbleweed.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250704193911\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8a/Sell_price_of_corrupted_tumbleweed.png/revision/latest?cb=20250704193911\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Sell Price of Corrupted Tumbleweed\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8a/Sell_price_of_corrupted_tumbleweed.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250704193911\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"133\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Sell price of corrupted tumbleweed.png\" data-image-key=\"Sell_price_of_corrupted_tumbleweed.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8a/Sell_price_of_corrupted_tumbleweed.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250704193911\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Sell_price_of_corrupted_tumbleweed.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Sell Price of Corrupted Tumbleweed</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>A normal <a href=\"/wiki/Tumbleweed\" title=\"Tumbleweed\">tumbleweed</a> becomes a corrupted tumbleweed by letting a <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\">Mysterious Mushroom</a> projectile hit the tumbleweed. It may also rarely be naturally available during future Halloween events in the case of the <a href=\"/wiki/Corrupt_Biome\" title=\"Corrupt Biome\">Corrupt Biome</a> returning.\n</p><p>The corrupted tumbleweed sells for 95 snowflakes (Christmas currency).\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/CXlhpOduNdc?si=JuCyKLiAIVua-KGD&amp;t=200\">https://youtu.be/CXlhpOduNdc?si=JuCyKLiAIVua-KGD&amp;t=200</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902223402\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 12/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 155/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3497-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902223402 and revision id 19745. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Corrupt Biome","exists":true},{"title":"Mysterious Mushrooms","exists":true},{"title":"Tumbleweed","exists":true},{"title":"Oke desert","exists":false}],"images":["Corrupted_Tumbleweed1.png.png","Corrupted_Tumbleweed_next_to_player.png","Corrupted_tumbleweed_jar.png","Sell_price_of_corrupted_tumbleweed.png"]}
